Subject: [PATCH] avalanche: add treasury contender voting, 50/25/25 reward
 split, and default slate

Add TreasuryContenderId, TreasuryPolicy, 50/25/25 coinbase reward split
(50% miner, 25% staking, 25% treasury), default node-developer treasury
slate with -avalanchetreasuryaddress override, and comprehensive unit
tests in treasury_tests.cpp.
